            <ArticleTitle>Metatarsal Coalition Complicated by Interdigital Neuroma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>286</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.2484/rcr.v4i2.286</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present the case of a 20-year-old man with the chief complaint of right foot pain for the past three years presenting with focal bony prominence at dorsomedial aspect of right mid foot with interdigital pain. MRI demonstrated a metatarsal coalition with interdigital neuroma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
